        <p>
          You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless freeqrcode-generator.com, its officers, agents, affiliates, and employees from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, judgments, losses, costs, expenses, or reasonable legal fees arising out of or relating to: (a) your violation of these Terms; (b) any content, URLs, or landing pages generated by you; (c) your infringement of any third-party intellectual property or privacy rights; or (d) any fraudulent or unlawful conduct committed through your account.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-600"></span> 9. DMCA Copyright & Intellectual Property Notice
        </h2>
        <p>
          We respect valid intellectual property rights and respond expeditiously to notices of alleged copyright infringement in accordance with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (17 U.S.C. § 512) and international copyright legislation.
        </p>
